      "title": "",
      "content": "offering (a-3) Corban, 'present,' noun derived from the verb translated 'present.' burnt-offering (b-6) The Hebrew words for the four offerings are. olah -- burnt-offering; minchah -- food-offering; shelem -- peace-offering; chataath -- sin-offering. See Ps. 40.6. blemish. (c-17) Perfect. see ch. 22.22,24."
    },
