      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 4,
      "title": "",
      "content": "burnt-offering; (b-12) The Hebrew words for the four offerings are. olah -- burnt-offering; minchah -- food-offering; shelem -- peace-offering; chataath -- sin-offering. See Ps. 40.6. lay (d-4) See Ex. 29.10; Lev. 3.2,8,13; 4.4,15,24,29,33, &c. atonement (e-22) See Note g, ch. 5.6."
